AI-generated promotional illustration created with OpenAI's built-in image
generator for this repository's sharing card, then palette-compressed with
pngquant. This is illustrative 3D artwork, not a Blender capture, a Scenario
service result, or evidence of an accepted plugin workflow. The original
Scenario mark is a separate asset with its own existing MIT notice.

The environment revision edits the source artwork from commit c91f1812 using
the built-in image generator. That commit retains the original generation
prompt and sculpture-focused source; the current source widens the setting to
show the gallery courtyard, terraces, water and receding architecture.

Environment revision prompt:
Use case: precise-object-edit.
Asset type: 2:1 promotional artwork behind a Blender extension social sharing card.
Input image 1 is the edit target: the existing stone-and-copper sculpture gallery
artwork.
Primary request: pull the camera well back and turn this into a complete, visibly
three-dimensional architectural environment. Preserve the same polished cinematic art
direction, ivory travertine, dark basalt and oxidized copper materials. The environment
should now be the main subject.
Scene: a spacious sculptural gallery courtyard with a clear foreground terrace, shallow
reflecting pools, broad steps, repeated tall stone arches receding into a second
courtyard, and a glimpse of a softly lit garden beyond. Strong perspective, layered
foreground/midground/background, coherent physically plausible architecture and material
detail. Keep the existing knot sculpture as a smaller focal point on a plinth in the
middle-right courtyard, fully visible with generous breathing room; it should occupy
only about one quarter of the total image height, rather than filling the frame.
Composition: wide 2:1 landscape, at least 1280 x 640. The left 43 percent must remain
almost-black, low-detail negative space for the existing typeset title. The visible
environment fills the right 57 percent from edge to edge, with depth leading diagonally
toward the upper-right. Keep the focal sculpture and brightest architectural detail
safely right of the text zone.
Lighting: preserve warm cinematic afternoon light, cool teal shadows, grounded contact
shadows and restrained reflective water; crisp readable environment at social thumbnail
size.
Constraints: no text, no logos, no UI, no buttons, no watermark, no people. This is an
AI-generated promotional illustration of a 3D environment. Preserve image aspect ratio
and left text-safe area.
